in the sleeve, my drone case, and a first aid kit. In the front compartment I had my drone
out as well as the batteries and the
controller. So when I wanted to fly, I opened one
zipper and I didn't have to dig past the 20-pound
plate to do it. On the outside, the webbing carried a
